  {
   "title": "Dialogue",
   "html": "<p class=\"muted\">Kèo aide Clara à écrire son prénom.</p><div class=\"dialogue\"><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ແກ້ວ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ເອື້ອຍຂຽນຊື່ເປັນບໍ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Ʉ̂ay khǐan sʉ̄ʉ pěn bɔ̌ɔ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຍັງ ຊ່ວຍແດ່</span><span class=\"rom\">Nyáng. Sūay dɛ̀ɛ.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ແກ້ວ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຄລາຣາຂຽນແບບນີ້</span><span class=\"rom\">Clara khǐan bɛ̏ɛp nȉi.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຂອບໃຈ ແລ້ວຊື່ເຈົ້າເດ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Khɔ̏ɔp-jǎy. Lɛ̏ɛw sʉ̄ʉ jâo dě?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ແກ້ວ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ແກ້ວ ງ່າຍໆ</span><span class=\"rom\">Kɛ̂ɛw. Ngāay ngāay.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ໂອເຄ ຂ້ອຍຈະລອງ</span><span class=\"rom\">Ǒo-khéé, khɔ̂ɔy já lɔ́ɔng.</span></div></div></div><details><summary>Traduction (seulement après avoir cherché)</summary><p><b>Kèo</b> — Tu sais écrire ton prénom ?<br><b>Clara</b> — Pas encore. Aide-moi.<br><b>Kèo</b> — Clara, ça s&#x27;écrit comme ça.<br><b>Clara</b> — Merci. Et ton prénom ?<br><b>Kèo</b> — Kèo. Facile.<br><b>Clara</b> — OK, je vais essayer.</p></details>"
